# TWICE** -- both found by this change's own adversarial pass, both corrected here.
#   · Its rationale said the directory was *"already MIXED"*, citing `cancelled-timeout/expected`
#     CRLF against `no-record/expected` LF. That measured the WORKING TREE. Re-measured
#     worktree-vs-index across all 24 files under `exit/` on 2026-09-23: **every index blob is LF**.
#     The mixedness is a local smudge artifact of which files this box happened to re-check-out
#     (`cancelled-timeout`, `gate-open`, `no-pack`, `resume-flag`), not a property of the repository.
